<title>KAZAKHSTAN: Kazakhstan auctions 900 mln tenge bills Aug 11-12.</title>
<headline>Kazakhstan auctions 900 mln tenge bills Aug 11-12.</headline>
<dateline>ALMATY 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kazakhstan will auction 200</p>
<p>million tenge ($2.6 million) of two-year MKM discount Treasury</p>
<p>bills on August 11 and 700 million tenge of three-month bills on</p>
<p>August 12, the National Bank said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Full details of the two-year issue:</p>
<p>    Series number		  KZ52K1208993</p>
<p>    Issue volume		   200 million tenge</p>
<p>    Denominations		  1,000 tenge</p>
<p>    Tenor			    two years</p>
<p>    Issue date		     Aug 11, 1997</p>
<p>    Maturity date		  Aug 12, 1999</p>
<p>   Full details of the three-month issue:</p>
<p>    Series number		  KZ43K1311978</p>
<p>    Issue volume		   700 million tenge</p>
<p>    Denominations		  100 tenge</p>
<p>    Tenor			    91 days</p>
<p>    Issue date		     Aug 12, 1997</p>
<p>    Maturity date		  Nov 13, 1997</p>
<p>($ = 75.7980 tenge)</p>
<p>--Almaty Newsroom, +7 3272 509410</p>
